(text "Channel A = HIGH_BUF - LOW_BUF; channel B = LOW_BUF - TIA_OUT.\nZ = [RF / (1+j*2*pi*f*RF*CF)] * A/B. CF=5pF only on 100k range.\nTHS4551 and ADS9224R filter network follows ADS9224R Figure 80.\nREFby2 drives VOCM. REFOUT is decoupled only. Each REFP uses 22uF." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "43d209c5-c4d7-5bd9-a136-38df3fedf59d"))
